nd some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adjectives and Adverbs to Describe Behavior and Personality ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about people you admire, you often describe their personalities and their behavior.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Their personality is their general character, the way they are.</br> <span class=\"italic\">Example: Maya Angelou was a brilliant writer.</span></p>Their behavior is the way they act or conduct themselves. You can use adverbs of manner when talking about their behavior. </br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Angelou worked tirelessly on her novels.</span></p> We use adjectives to talk about behavior and personality.</p>Adverbs of manner describe how something is done.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "legend", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who is famous and admired for being really good at something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Maya Angelou is considered by many to be an American legend.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you can use to talk about Maya Angelou.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "multi-tasker ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who can to do several things at the same time ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was known to be a multi-tasker. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "acclaimed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "publicly praised by a lot of people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Maya Angelou wrote an acclaimed series. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "intense ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having a very strong effect; felt very strongly ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She worked intensely on her novel. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "driven", "type": "name"}, {"content": "trying extremely hard to achieve what you want", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was driven and worked hard.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to push", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to encourage or force you or someone to do something; to work hard", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She pushed me to the limit. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ability", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the state of being able to do something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She tried to best of her ability. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "notable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the ability to be noticed or mentioned", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She is notable for her work in literature. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go on the Internet.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do some research about famous writers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose one and describe their routine. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a 7 to 9 sentence summary about their routine.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your summary and share it with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about routines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about a person I admire.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I tell my partner about a person's routine.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}